<title>UK: Daimler sees positive trend continuing.</title>
<headline>Daimler sees positive trend continuing.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG, Germany's largest conglomerate, said on Thursday it expected a positive earnings trend to continue into the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;We are pleased that the tough steps we took last year are turning Daimler-Benz into a company focused on achieving world class profitability,&quot; chairman Juergen Schrempp told a news conference in London.</p>
</text>
